{"content":[{"c":["PELONITE*"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Designation given to two of David’s mighty men, Helez and Ahijah (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.11.27,36","r":"1Chr.11.27,36","rawR":"1Chr.11.27,36","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.11.27,36","value":"1Chr.11.27,36"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 11:27, 36"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.27.10","r":"1Chr.27.10","rawR":"1Chr.27.10","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.27.10","value":"1Chr.27.10"}],"t":"ref","v":"27:10"},", ",{"c":["nlt"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"}," “from Pelon”). No sources for the designation are known, which has led some scholars to consider it a textual corruption. In ",{"href":"?bref=2Sam.23.26","r":"2Sam.23.26","rawR":"2Sam.23.26","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Sam.23.26","value":"2Sam.23.26"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Samuel 23:26"},", Helez is called a Paltite, and Ahijah is probably identical to Eliam the Gilonite in ",{"href":"?bref=2Sam.23.34","r":"2Sam.23.34","rawR":"2Sam.23.34","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Sam.23.34","value":"2Sam.23.34"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Samuel 23:34"},". The latter are preferred over “Pelonite” in both cases. Others suggest that Pelonite is derived from the town Beth-pelet (see ",{"href":"?bref=Josh.15.27","r":"Josh.15.27","rawR":"Josh.15.27","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.15.27","value":"Josh.15.27"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 15:27"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Neh.11.26","r":"Neh.11.26","rawR":"Neh.11.26","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.11.26","value":"Neh.11.26"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 11:26"},")."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Pelonite","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"1 Chr 11:27, 36","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.11.27,36","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.11.27,36","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.11.27,36"},{"anchorText":"27:10","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.27.10","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.27.10","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.27.10"},{"anchorText":"2 Samuel 23:26","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Sam.23.26","rawQueryValue":"2Sam.23.26","sourceRefExact":"2Sam.23.26"},{"anchorText":"2 Samuel 23:34","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Sam.23.34","rawQueryValue":"2Sam.23.34","sourceRefExact":"2Sam.23.34"},{"anchorText":"Jos 15:27","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.15.27","rawQueryValue":"Josh.15.27","sourceRefExact":"Josh.15.27"},{"anchorText":"Neh 11:26","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.11.26","rawQueryValue":"Neh.11.26","sourceRefExact":"Neh.11.26"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"0ddf2ee5295ada05345a4c5995f4590d5106953dc5fd17d283fdd05e06e279ad","sourceItemName":"Pelonite","sourceItemOrder":94,"sourceMember":"Articles/P.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Pelonite","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Pelonite*","title":"Pelonite*","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}